In the middle of the day, I walk down to the canteen.
The room is bright and nice.
Many people are standing by the buffet.
I see my colleague Peter.
He takes a plate with food.
"Hello Maya," he says with a smile.
"Hello Peter," I reply.
We take some bread and salad.
Together we find table number nine by the window.
We sit down on the chairs.
The food tastes really good.
Peter talks about his project.
He works with new software.
I listen and nod.
Finally I talk about my own code.
We drink a glass of water.
I enjoy myself a lot during the break.
Soon we walk back to the office.
